{"title":"Manuale olosecurity · OLOtheme","slug":"olosecurity-manuale","kind":"page","content":[{"id":"6b2d95cb-af15-4cef-aabd-f7c21f19dfa9","type":"section","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"light_color":"#26B8E8","style":"default","width":"default","padding":"custom","padding_top_custom":130,"padding_bottom_custom":30,"bg_scope":"section","sticky_effect":"none"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"a70c6210-10f0-4866-849a-7c1bd7d9fa3e","type":"row","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"layout":"100","stack_mobile":true},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"a9d90213-3aac-41a7-a5c5-a20fa80c6426","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"1-1"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"a1f529f3-fc79-4313-afd7-a09700d9d962","type":"pagelight","settings":{"light_color":"#26B8E8","base_color":"#0C0E13","position":"top-right","size":95,"intensity":22,"transition_ms":800},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"dcbeb916-8b00-47ee-b25e-b3384b615b4a","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"doc OLO-SEC-M01 · manuale base · + scheda tecnica · v1.2.0","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#8B90A0","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"10","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2.5","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"f47015ea-7a6d-4bff-b500-693d12d900ab","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"20"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"36417dd4-79ca-4f60-a913-cb944e9bb1f8","type":"image","settings":{"image_url":"/wp-content/uploads/olotheme-site/olosecurity-orizz.png","alt_text":"olosecurity","image_width":"170px","height":"auto","object_fit":"contain","image_alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"2fcb41cd-4500-45cc-9d91-374ab162c55d","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"18"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"805e988b-9a25-4ea3-8cf6-3528be107bba","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Manuale base","accent_text":"base","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h1","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"56","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"c470c9c2-eb9b-4ff4-ad1d-ed3c08f29995","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"12"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"aa9ed98b-787b-4eaf-a314-cf6868064d6d","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<p>Il pannello Sentinel e le quattro linee di difesa: prevenzione, identità, rilevamento, reazione. Tutto elaborato in locale.</p>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"16","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"e53c3400-c643-4c39-8f4d-6c1ebd09f425","type":"section","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"light_color":"#26B8E8","style":"default","width":"default","padding":"custom","padding_top_custom":20,"padding_bottom_custom":120,"bg_scope":"section","sticky_effect":"none"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"4ebb95a0-b541-458b-a921-11edbaa9ad0b","type":"row","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"layout":"25-75","stack_mobile":true},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"c9a64661-8c7c-4495-a16a-6a20ff2daf6d","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"1-4"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"2180ffb7-8d5a-4e95-82a7-43d237a2147f","type":"toc","settings":{"title":"Sommario","max_depth":"2","list_style":"numbered","sticky":true,"highlight_active":true,"smooth_scroll":true,"typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","text_color":"#8B90A0","link_color":"#B9BDC9","title_color":"#FAF7F2"},"style":[],"advanced":[]}]},{"id":"5b4e2c92-57c1-486b-9039-1bb0ee92c5a9","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"3-4"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"347964c9-6ffa-4796-a87c-6bade8c7f04a","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c1"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"569fa278-c107-4a04-94a0-a771269a600a","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§1","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"7c6a29c4-54da-4647-adf1-7f8aad02bac7","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"37b1d0df-b1cf-4cec-9569-9ed6991580e2","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Cos’è OLOsecurity","accent_text":"OLOsecurity","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"e9983dbd-2592-4684-8e87-9b4b96c2c51b","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"3eb8b086-cf6e-47fc-9c9c-3d59bad08306","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<p>OLOsecurity è un plugin di sicurezza WordPress <strong>all-in-one</strong>: firewall, antivirus, gestione accessi con 2FA, audit e bonifica in un unico pannello, <strong>Sentinel</strong>, 8 schede operative.</p><p>La scelta di fondo: <strong>elaborazione 100% locale</strong>. Analisi, firme e log restano sul tuo server; nessun traffico viene spedito a cloud terzi per essere “analizzato”. Nessun dataset di terzi è impacchettato nel plugin: i feed si scaricano on-demand dal tuo sito. GDPR semplice.</p><p><strong>Conformità — </strong>Codice GPL, verificabile riga per riga. <strong>WP Plugin Check: 0 errori / 0 warning.</strong></p>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"3be9184c-4907-445a-bd23-f9be00d82699","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"55e1710a-a3a2-4fc3-aaa6-dda64c504b61","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c2"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"36960e17-d432-446e-a12f-d991836843fa","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§2","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"0ea0bc9d-56fd-436b-9116-fb72caa1b031","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"1017bd38-f5ec-4db9-93af-e3eca8c58194","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Firewall · mini-WAF","accent_text":"mini-WAF","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"927212eb-1c6c-4693-8b95-487a13036dab","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"cd7b1ff4-4cfc-4620-8bb2-728657e9811e","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<ul><li><strong>Regole per famiglia OWASP</strong>: SQL injection, XSS, path traversal, LFI/RCE, attivabili a gruppi.</li><li><strong>Reputazione IP</strong> da liste pubbliche + regole di blocco avanzate.</li><li><strong>Rate limiting</strong> sulle richieste anomale.</li><li><strong>Geo-blocco</strong> IPv4 e IPv6 per paese.</li><li><strong>Proxy fidati</strong>: riconoscimento di Cloudflare e reti locali per valutare correttamente <code>X-Forwarded-For</code>.</li></ul>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"152aa88b-9041-4312-853e-bb1be7bf7718","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"5b9a3e8a-0003-4c43-bfb0-fef5f4745840","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c3"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"a0b570b9-fbcb-4f2f-a4ed-e39bbc2515eb","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§3","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"4f0cc33d-80fd-4a2f-8162-ac63491abcca","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"9dc46ae3-5284-477a-ad05-6e9d15e56d1d","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Accessi & 2FA","accent_text":"2FA","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"f653f008-ff79-46c9-95f5-272afa26db7d","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"c5cb0b41-dc36-47cc-97f8-e89d325bd3ed","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<ul><li><strong>Anti brute-force</strong>: limite tentativi, lockout temporizzato, auto-blocklist permanente per IP recidivi, allowlist/blocklist.</li><li><strong>2FA TOTP</strong>: setup con QR, codici di recupero, fallback email, reset admin.</li><li><strong>Password compromesse</strong>: verifica su HIBP con k-anonymity: la password non lascia mai il server.</li><li><strong>CAPTCHA</strong> e blocco enumerazione utenti.</li><li><strong>Anti finti crawler</strong>: verifica FCrDNS: chi si spaccia per Googlebot viene smascherato.</li><li><strong>Hardening opzionale</strong>: XML-RPC, security header, occultamento versione, <code>DISALLOW_FILE_EDIT</code>, blocco upload PHP, protezione .htaccess.</li></ul>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"b7bd26cf-1fa3-45b3-80d2-aa56d70a0b26","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"db7ffc40-7a36-44fb-9ce9-a0eff27f29fc","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c4"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"1e247671-82d4-42b8-b01a-48590d32b903","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§4","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"cf1b1240-0d87-40fc-994d-69b6a5a81287","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"2524067e-92a7-4166-8eb6-6cc7e05a035f","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Scanner · tre passaggi","accent_text":"tre passaggi","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"5f0b2437-b537-451f-801e-e16aaf9be8c2","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"ebdce299-97a5-4817-bef0-7bef33a99c97","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<ul><li><strong>Integrità / checksum</strong>: baseline trust-on-first-use; confronto di core, plugin e temi con wordpress.org; rileva i file modificati.</li><li><strong>Euristica profonda</strong>: scorre i file PHP (salta i non eseguibili) con 5 euristiche forti calibrate anti falsi-positivi; la doppia estensione mascherata (es. <code>.jpg.php</code>) è trattata come webshell quasi certa.</li><li><strong>Firme malware</strong>: passaggio per hash MD5/SHA256 sul feed firme: lookup O(1), costo trascurabile.</li></ul><p>Prestazioni: <strong>~11.000 file PHP in ~2–3 secondi</strong> su un sito tipico; sugli hosting con timeout, modalità a blocchi con ripresa. Feed CVE per plugin e temi installati, aggiornamento giornaliero via cron, indici con autoload OFF.</p>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"113c2c1b-21be-4a20-a654-854f5d3a1ec0","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"a92183f0-11da-4380-b11c-3e99ba88bf64","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c5"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"6821450e-57a9-44ec-9ece-15dcb0131e3e","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§5","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"d2de81f7-d636-4a2d-a11d-35edae3ada46","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"bb7bd29f-20bd-4354-84d4-d99334b7eccf","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Ripristino & registro","accent_text":"registro","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"2f2e55b1-8921-4ae7-b1de-f8c365e2a76e","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"6e0ec66c-30ac-413c-91b2-1c83b71865bd","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<ul><li><strong>Bonifica guidata</strong> post-attacco: riparazione core one-click dalla versione ufficiale, reinstallazione plugin/temi da wordpress.org con backup automatico.</li><li><strong>Quarantena reversibile</strong> dei file sospetti.</li><li><strong>Rigenerazione salt</strong> e report d’incidente pronto da consegnare.</li><li><strong>Audit log</strong> “chi/cosa/quando” su tabella dedicata, filtrabile, export CSV, conservazione 90 giorni.</li><li><strong>Monitoraggio</strong>: traffico in tempo reale, grafico eventi, monitor spazio disco, digest email, webhook.</li></ul>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"6fb762ec-ae08-4dd5-997b-2deff3eac82a","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"869b3f8f-0b0a-4859-9b6d-455806ec8904","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"spec"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"62edb7d9-c45e-48ac-985e-ca9c6b6296f9","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Scheda tecnica","accent_text":"tecnica","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"40","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"82933b28-e09f-42e5-916d-08990b18e1c2","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"10"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"6e2a63a6-535f-407d-8627-350bce88675f","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"OLOsecurity v1.2.0 · GPLv2 or later · Plugin Check 0/0","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"11","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"286703c4-1650-4e25-9a19-33a2d73b4502","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"22"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"1be78a90-cf3e-4878-8e35-76daa7e942c6","type":"desclist","settings":{"items":[{"id":"sp-0","term":"Tipo","definition":"Plugin di sicurezza WordPress all-in-one · pannello Sentinel, 8 schede","icon":""},{"id":"sp-1","term":"Requisiti","definition":"WordPress 5.9+ (testato fino a WP 7.0) · PHP 7.4+","icon":""},{"id":"sp-2","term":"Elaborazione","definition":"100% locale, nessun traffico verso cloud terzi","icon":""},{"id":"sp-3","term":"Firewall","definition":"Mini-WAF: regole OWASP per famiglia, reputazione IP, rate limiting, geo-blocco IPv4/IPv6","icon":""},{"id":"sp-4","term":"Accessi","definition":"Anti brute-force, 2FA TOTP + recupero, HIBP k-anonymity, CAPTCHA, FCrDNS","icon":""},{"id":"sp-5","term":"Scanner","definition":"Checksum vs wordpress.org · 5 euristiche anti-webshell · hash MD5/SHA256 O(1)","icon":""},{"id":"sp-6","term":"Prestazioni","definition":"~11.000 file PHP in ~2–3 s · modalità a blocchi con ripresa","icon":""},{"id":"sp-7","term":"Feed","definition":"maldet/rfxn.com, InterServer (~76.000 firme) · OpenPhish + URLhaus (~30.000 URL) · api.wordpress.org (checksum, CVE) · cron giornaliero","icon":""},{"id":"sp-8","term":"Ripristino","definition":"Bonifica guidata, quarantena reversibile, rigenerazione salt, report incidente","icon":""},{"id":"sp-9","term":"Registro","definition":"Audit log su tabella dedicata · export CSV · 90 giorni","icon":""},{"id":"sp-10","term":"Licenza","definition":"GPLv2 or later · WP Plugin Check 0 errori / 0 warning","icon":""}],"layout":"stacked","show_icon":false,"separator":true,"striped":false,"term_color":"#FAF7F2","term_font_size":"14","term_font_weight":"700","definition_color":"#B9BDC9","definition_font_size":"14","border_color":"rgba(250,247,242,.12)","spacing":"14","text_align":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]}]}]},{"id":"54d3b84e-db78-4a88-88e2-e80ea8c86a7c","type":"row","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"layout":"25-75","stack_mobile":true},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"5d0b4fff-23be-46c8-b829-20fc73d066b1","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"1-4"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[]},{"id":"fce934af-5d08-4ad6-bfd7-c2d6e3e19bda","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"3-4","flex_direction":"row","flex_wrap":"wrap","flex_align":"center","flex_column_gap":"12","flex_row_gap":"12"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"e60f9457-3c5e-4026-a792-3bbcaa7ef83e","type":"button","settings":{"text":"← Torna alla scheda prodotto","url":"/olosecurity/","alignment":"left","bg_color":"#26B8E8","text_color":"#0C0E13","hover_bg_color":"#FAF7F2","hover_text_color":"#0C0E13","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"700","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","border_radius":{"tl":3,"tr":3,"br":3,"bl":3},"tile_padding":{"top":15,"right":24,"bottom":15,"left":24}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"63918e22-d6e6-4041-8faf-d5b129037f71","type":"button","settings":{"text":"Il viaggio OLOtheme","url":"/","alignment":"left","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#FAF7F2","hover_bg_color":"rgba(250,247,242,.08)","hover_text_color":"#FAF7F2","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"700","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","border_radius":{"tl":3,"tr":3,"br":3,"bl":3},"tile_padding":{"top":15,"right":24,"bottom":15,"left":24},"border":{"top":1,"right":1,"bottom":1,"left":1,"linked":true,"style":"solid","color":"rgba(250,247,242,.3)"}},"style":[],"advanced":[]}]}]}]}]}